stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Unauthenticated: User arrives at Holoraa

    Unauthenticated --> AuthenticatedIncomplete: Verifies email OTP code
    note right of AuthenticatedIncomplete
        users table row created.
        username IS NULL.
        profileComplete: false.
        Restricted to /app/profile?setup=1.
    end note

    AuthenticatedIncomplete --> ValidatingHandle: User enters proposed username
    ValidatingHandle --> HandleCollision: Database unique constraint error (23505)
    HandleCollision --> AuthenticatedIncomplete: Inline warning ("Username taken")

    ValidatingHandle --> HandleReserved: Reserved word match (admin, root, me, etc.)
    HandleReserved --> AuthenticatedIncomplete: Inline warning ("Username reserved")

    ValidatingHandle --> ProfileActive: Available & valid syntax committed
    note right of ProfileActive
        users.username set.
        profileComplete: true.
        Full workspace access granted.
        Searchable in user discovery.
    end note

    ProfileActive --> EditingProfile: Opens profile settings
    EditingProfile --> ProfileActive: Discards changes
    EditingProfile --> UpdatingProfile: Submits PATCH /v1/me (Bio, Display Name, Avatar)

    UpdatingProfile --> ProfileActive: 200 OK (Updates revalidated in UI)
    UpdatingProfile --> EditingProfile: Validation error (Control chars, URL invalid)

    ProfileActive --> Unauthenticated: User signs out / session expires
